    "description": {
      "content": "This API provides a method to retrieve deferred deep linking information after a user installs and opens a mobile app for the first time. \nIt is designed to be called from within the app to get the original deep link URL and other attribution data, enabling you to direct the user to the correct content. \nThis endpoint only provides information and does not log a conversion event.",
